        "# Horror Movies Dataset — Complete Data Preprocessing & EDA Workflow\n",
        "\n",
        "**Team:** Al Ameen · Nikhil · Devika · Vyas · Felicia  \n",
        "**Dataset:** `horror_movies.csv`  \n",
        "**Purpose:** Exploratory data analysis and preparation of a supervised regression dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Team task allocation\n",
        "\n",
        "| Member | Responsibility |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| **Al Ameen** | Dataset loading, inspection and EDA |\n",
        "| **Nikhil** | Data cleaning and feature engineering |\n",
        "| **Devika** | Distribution and categorical analysis; target/leakage review |\n",
        "| **Vyas** | Split and numerical/categorical preprocessing |\n",
        "| **Felicia** | Target review, imbalance applicability, correlation, feature selection and verification |\n",
        "\n",
        "## Prediction objective\n",
        "\n",
        "**Target column: `vote_average`**\n",
        "\n",
        "The task is to predict a movie's average audience rating (`vote_average`). This is a **regression problem** because the target is numeric and continuous-like, not a class label.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
