      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Missing-value handling decisions\n",
        "Based on the reference notebook:\n",
        "- collection and collection_name are highly sparse and are excluded.\n",
        "- tagline, overview, backdrop_path, and poster_path are free-text or image-path fields and are excluded from this tabular baseline.\n",
        "- Zero budget and revenue values are changed to NaN, because zero may indicate that the information was not reported. This is a project assumption, not a fact about every record.\n",
        "- The remaining selected numerical predictors are filled using the median.\n",
        "- The remaining selected categorical predictors are filled using the mode."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "vBXT67k79rvr"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for column in ['budget', 'revenue']:\n",
        "    if column in df_clean.columns:\n",
        "        df_clean.loc[df_clean[column] == 0, column] = np.nan\n",
        "\n",
        "columns_to_drop = [\n",
        "    'collection',\n",
        "    'collection_name',\n",
        "    'tagline',\n",
        "    'overview',\n",
        "    'backdrop_path',\n",
        "    'poster_path'\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "columns_to_drop = [col for col in columns_to_drop if col in df_clean.columns]\n",
        "df_clean = df_clean.drop(columns=columns_to_drop)\n",
        "\n",
        "print('Columns excluded from baseline:', columns_to_drop)\n",
        "print('Shape after excluding columns:', df_clean.shape)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "collapsed": true,
        "id": "dx-OSzXd92rT",
        "outputId": "9d3e469d-4e50-4cf5-9670-b1d2bcc743d9",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 35,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Columns excluded from baseline: ['collection', 'collection_name', 'tagline', 'overview', 'backdrop_path', 'poster_path']\n",
            "Shape after excluding columns: (32540, 15)\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Impute missing values in selected predictors\n",
        "The reference notebook uses these baseline predictors:\n",
        "\n",
        "Numerical: budget, runtime, release_year, release_month\n",
        "\n",
        "Categorical: original_language, status, genre_names\n",
        "\n",
        "We only impute columns that are present in this dataset. The median is used for numerical columns because it is less affected by extreme values. The most frequent value (mode) is used for categorical columns."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "k6MZq0V79-jo"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "numeric_predictors = [\n",
        "    col for col in ['budget', 'runtime', 'release_year', 'release_month']\n",
        "    if col in df_clean.columns\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "categorical_predictors = [\n",
        "    col for col in ['original_language', 'status', 'genre_names']\n",
        "    if col in df_clean.columns\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "for column in numeric_predictors:\n",
        "    median_value = df_clean[column].median()\n",
        "    df_clean[column] = df_clean[column].fillna(median_value)\n",
        "    print(f'{column}: missing values filled with median = {median_value}')\n",
        "\n",
        "for column in categorical_predictors:\n",
        "    mode_values = df_clean[column].mode(dropna=True)\n",
        "    if not mode_values.empty:\n",
        "        mode_value = mode_values.iloc[0]\n",
        "        df_clean[column] = df_clean[column].fillna(mode_value)\n",
        "        print(f'{column}: missing values filled with mode = {mode_value}')"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "collapsed": true,
        "id": "xk5qowAJ-KYR",
        "outputId": "1856db7f-a11c-44a6-c85c-e1dd3437088e",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 36,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "budget: missing values filled with median = 50000.0\n",
            "runtime: missing values filled with median = 80.0\n",
            "release_year: missing values filled with median = 2012.0\n",
            "original_language: missing values filled with mode = en\n",
            "status: missing values filled with mode = Released\n",
            "genre_names: missing values filled with mode = Horror\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "handled_predictors = numeric_predictors + categorical_predictors\n",
        "\n",
        "remaining_missing = df_clean[handled_predictors].isnull().sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "print('Missing values in selected predictors after handling:')\n",
        "display(remaining_missing.to_frame('Remaining Missing Values'))\n",
        "\n",
